Changes to the adapted apps: directories renamed. headroom-context-optimization/headroom_demo.py was
rewritten to call the real headroom.compress() and report measured token counts
(the original used a hand-picked list of log entries and did not call Headroom).
README savings figures in headroom-context-optimization and
toonify-token-optimization were relabeled as project-reported. See git history
for later changes.
